comments.body:
@alexmoir1 Can we close this?
If you are still experiencing this, would you like to try Nightscout sync as an alternative?
Thanks

@alexmoir1  If your followers are using the Nightscout follower option, you can disable the xDrip sync on the master, which will stop getting the max sync queue size exceeded error.

On the master, go to the following page:
Settings -> xDrip+ Sync Settings, and deselect "Be master for followers".
